    "note": "Matches M0/M1_stimulus_kernel's own convergence tolerances; no_probability_normalization_errors is dropped because this evaluator has no renormalization step -- pi_t is exactly the previous feedback-valid category (or 0.5 before any feedback), so it is bounded in [0,1] by construction, and the evaluator additionally raises immediately if pi_t is ever non-finite (see wsls_core_v1/evaluator.py)."
